    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d128-a1">

                <pb facs="0259" n="167" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg167"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-04-02"><hi rendition="#italic">April 2,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>German military expedition has been sent to interior of Shantung professedly to
                    preserve order and to protect German missionaries and engineers, and have been
                    instructed by German Government to protect Americans in case of necessity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
